model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "Overlapping hosted section navigations preserve one router pending boundary until content is ready. Leaving a section that has presented content still unmounts its active subscriptions, so inactive sections make no focus, visibility or periodic reads. First-entry and forced preceding-route-download guards retain their pending-element, revisit and deadline assertions on desktop and phone. Setup redirection and child-route matching continue to govern the pending transition, so a redirect cannot preserve a departed section's background reads."
    }
  }
}
